        "created_at": "2017-10-13T14:56:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Looping back to Apostate, one thing that hasn't been mentioned yet but that I found interesting was how Fanatic and Apostate were each differently affected by their humanity.&nbsp; Fanatic's humanity was what saved her from being even&nbsp;<em>more</em> judgemental, and yet Apostate's humanity was his downfall that led him to change from \"mess with Fanatic\" to \"burn the world and rule over the ashes\".</p>",
        "post_number": 71,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:35:39.606Z",
