      {
        "id": 206205,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-13T16:15:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dprcooke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/48/1961_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dprcooke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As for Cult of Gloom, that doesn't fully surprise me.&nbsp; Their letters are very distinctive, and there were one or two recently that didn't sound quite right.&nbsp; I had orginally just assumed that the letter was rushed, but someone else having written it makes more sense.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually, AFAIK there is just the one Cult of Gloom writer; what I meant was that the Cult of Gloom writer somehow knows there's more than one Biomancer letter writer. Sorry for the unclear wording.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dprcooke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/48/1961_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dprcooke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>and that squabbling ended up being resolved via PM–as fact which, if I'm permitted to opine, I thought was very impressive and made me appreciate all the wonderful people on these forums.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Me too; I've had squabbles in other fandoms where attempts to resolve them left me at best with an enemy and at worst with me having to actually leave the fandom, obviously neither of which result I liked very much.</p>",
