      {
        "id": 206208,
        "name": "Escher",
        "username": "Escher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/escher/{size}/4865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-14T15:58:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dprcooke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/48/1961_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dprcooke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Jeysie wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Also also, am I the only one who felt a little bit sheepish when Christopher called out all the Fanatic discussion on the forums during this episode? It was kind of this guilty feeling of \"Oh yeah, Dad was listening to us squabble...\"\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nDad might have caught the kids squabbling, but overall he still seems to be pretty proud.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'd think any creator would be happier to see people discussing their work to the point of getting upset than to see no discussion happening, so there's that.</p>",
