        "created_at": "2017-10-16T15:53:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>bobbertoriley wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;Also, now I'm curious how big of a fan Adam is of The Wallflowers. That was a deep cut pull for a group most people only know for One Headlight.&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;Can't say I'm a fan necessarily, but their cover of Heroes was actually the first Wallflowers song I ever heard, so even I was impressed by that reference. :)\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ah, Godzilla 1998.&nbsp; Atrocious Movie, great sountrack.&nbsp; I wonder if i still have my copy…</p>",
