        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-16T16:35:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am Sad people didn't know Black Sabbath&nbsp;and Dio. I laugh so hard the first time I open the base game and read the flavor text. Love old metal music.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I agree with most that Apostate went for a meh villain&nbsp;to my favorite one now (besides La Captain and Baron Blade). So much ham. My favorite is him saying he wants to work together with Fanatic in the graveyard while she cuts in down. That probably&nbsp;messed he up for a bit. A+ troll.</p>",
